<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rates rise to 6.9 percent.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rates rise to 6.9 percent.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-07-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar rose to 6.90 percent on Saturday from 4.44 percent on Tuesday, the last day the Central Bank published dinar overnight rates.</p>
<p>The Central Bank said four banks traded in 13 reported transactions worth 20.7 million dinars ($29.2 million).</p>
<p>($1=0.709 dinars)</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
</text>
